---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { absoluteUrl, buildBreadcrumbSchema, pageSeo } from '../../lib/seo';

const metadata = pageSeo.mechanics;
const schema = [
  { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'CollectionPage', name: metadata.h1, description: metadata.description, url: absoluteUrl(metadata.canonicalPath) },
  buildBreadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Greedy Growers Calculator', path: '/' }, { name: 'Mechanics', path: metadata.canonicalPath }]),
];
---

<BaseLayout title={metadata.title} description={metadata.description} canonicalPath={metadata.canonicalPath} schema={schema}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">The game's differentiating decision</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.045em] text-white sm:text-6xl">{metadata.h1}</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-sand-300">Separate what lightning officially does from the strategy decision of when to harvest. This keeps facts and player risk tolerance from becoming one vague page.</p></div>

    <section class="mt-16" aria-label="Greedy Growers mechanics map"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Mechanics map</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Harvest timing covers strategy, capital exposure, and failed-run recovery. Lightning covers confirmed consequences and evidence around reported signals.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><a href="/mechanics/when-to-harvest/" class="rounded-2xl border border-leaf-500/35 bg-leaf-500/[.045] p-7 no-underline hover:border-leaf-500/70"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Highest priority</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">When to Harvest — Strategy and Break-Even Timing</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Choose conservative, balanced, or maximum-greed timing and calculate the recovery line after failed runs.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400">Compare harvest timing strategies →</span></a><a href="/mechanics/lightning/" class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-7 no-underline hover:border-leaf-500/50"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Mechanism facts</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Lightning — Confirmed Facts and Risk Signals</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">What a strike can do, which signals are confirmed, and which time, height, or seed claims remain unverified.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400">Review lightning evidence →</span></a></div></section>

    <aside class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><p class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Lightning facts versus harvest strategy</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">“Can lightning destroy this run?” is a mechanism question about consequences and evidence. “Should I keep waiting?” is a strategy question about bankroll, target return, and accepted loss.</p></aside>

    <aside class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-300/[.06] p-6"><p class="font-bold text-amber-100">Why Greedy Growers multipliers are not published yet</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">The multiplier formula, upper limit, and relationship among tree height, value, and displayed multiplier still need repeatable tests. Until then, 200x and 1000x community challenge terms should not drive the Calculator.</p></aside>

    <nav class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/" class="rounded-md bg-leaf-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-ink-950 no-underline">Open the Calculator</a><a href="/guides/get-money-fast/" class="rounded-md border border-leaf-500/35 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400 no-underline">Protect your coins</a><a href="/updates/" class="rounded-md border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white no-underline">Check updates</a></nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
